[{"title":"耳机里的片刻","url":"/journal/music/","content":"<p class=\"music-intro\">有些旋律，适合把时间放慢一点。</p>\n\n<p>对不起high horse ，对不起转转，对不起KNOW ABOUT ME，对不起ADORE YOU，对不起跑玫瑰，对不起蓝情，对不起年轻笨蛋傻子，对不起LOVE ME LIKE THIS，对不起DASH，对不起饼饼饼，对不起OCEAN，对不起RICO，对不起O.O，对不起DICE，我是 crescendo 的毒唯，我家birthday wish艺术性秒了悦耳度秒了震撼度秒了，我家birthday wish就是这样出色，别家歌不要来碰瓷，2026乐评王我们来了！</p>\n<div class=\"music-bgm\" data-bgm-player><audio data-bgm-audio src=\"/assets/nmixx-birthday-wish.mp3\" preload=\"none\" loop></audio><button type=\"button\" data-bgm-toggle data-bgm-title=\"NMIXX · Birthday Wish\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"播放背景音乐：NMIXX · Birthday Wish\"><span class=\"music-disc\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span data-bgm-label>听一会儿</span><small>NMIXX · Birthday Wish</small></button><details class=\"music-volume\" data-bgm-settings><summary aria-label=\"背景音乐音量设置\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4 5 9H2v6h3l6 5Z\"/><path class=\"sound-on\" d=\"M15 8a6 6 0 0 1 0 8m3-11a10 10 0 0 1 0 14\"/><path class=\"sound-off\" d=\"m16 9 6 6m0-6-6 6\"/></svg><span>音量</span></summary><div class=\"music-volume-panel\"><button type=\"button\" data-bgm-mute aria-label=\"静音\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"静音\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4 5 9H2v6h3l6 5Z\"/><path class=\"sound-on\" d=\"M15 8a6 6 0 0 1 0 8m3-11a10 10 0 0 1 0 14\"/><path class=\"sound-off\" d=\"m16 9 6 6m0-6-6 6\"/></svg></button><input type=\"range\" data-bgm-volume min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"15\" aria-label=\"背景音乐音量\" aria-valuetext=\"15%\"><output data-bgm-level>15%</output></div></details><span class=\"sr-only\" data-bgm-status aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"画面与旋律\"><a href=\"#画面与旋律\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"画面与旋律\"></a>画面与旋律</h2><div class=\"music-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"music-photo music-photo-wide\">\n<a href=\"/assets/nmixx-strange-muse.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"查看 NMIXX Strange Muse 宣传图\"><img src=\"/assets/nmixx-strange-muse.webp\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"NMIXX Strange Muse 官方宣传合照\"></a>\n<figcaption><span>Strange Muse</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"music-photo\">\n<a href=\"/assets/irene-like-a-flower.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"查看 IRENE Like A Flower 预告照片\"><img src=\"/assets/irene-like-a-flower.webp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"IRENE Like A Flower 水面与雏菊预告照片\"></a>\n<figcaption><span>Like A Flower</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"music-photo\">\n<a href=\"/assets/red-velvet-surfin-boy.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"查看 Red Velvet Surfin’ Boy 海边宣传图\"><img src=\"/assets/red-velvet-surfin-boy.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1334\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Red Velvet Surfin’ Boy 蓝天、沙滩与彩色冲浪板宣传合照\"></a>\n<figcaption><span>Surfin’ Boy</span></figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n\n","categories":["音乐"],"tags":["音乐"]},{"title":"Crazy Cow：一个奶牛小游戏","url":"/journal/crazy-cow/","content":"<h2 id=\"怎么玩\"><a href=\"#怎么玩\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"怎么玩\"></a>怎么玩</h2><p>在牧场里跑动、吃草，躲开饲养员。也可以试试冲撞。</p>\n<p>电脑上用 WASD 或方向键移动，Shift 冲刺，F 冲撞，靠近草地后按住空格吃草。手机上用屏幕摇杆和按钮。</p>\n<p>有挑战和自由漫游两种模式，存档保存在当前浏览器。</p>\n<div class=\"post-actions\"><a href=\"https://xiuy07.github.io/crazy-cow/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">直接游玩 <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/xiuy07/crazy-cow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看源码 <i class=\"fab fa-github\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"还有一头像素奶牛\"><a href=\"#还有一头像素奶牛\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"还有一头像素奶牛\"></a>还有一头像素奶牛</h2><p>404 页面里藏着一个跑酷小游戏。跳过草垛和栅栏，按住 ↓ 低头躲开飞鸟；手机上也有跳跃和低头按钮。</p>\n<div class=\"post-actions\"><a href=\"/404.html\">去玩牧场跑跑 <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"开发记录\"><a href=\"#开发记录\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"开发记录\"></a>开发记录</h2><p>做这个游戏的起因、遇到的问题和后续打算，待补充。</p>\n","categories":["小作品"],"tags":["小游戏"]}]